OL,3,GNEWSATeeth reveal hard lives of
OL,4,Amedieval lead mining communities
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of medieval Derbyshire may have
OL,7,Fhad worse pollution than during the
OL,8,FIndustrial Revolution - and women may
OL,9,Fhave suffered the most, archaeologists
OL,10,Fhave found.
OL,12,FThe Peak District was a centre for lead
OL,13,Fproduction in the Roman period but
OL,14,Fdetails of it restarting after the
OL,15,Fimperial era were unclear.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
