OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1792304805
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSATeeth reveal hard lives of
OL,4,Amedieval lead mining communities
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnalysis of lead deposits in teeth from
OL,7,Fburials in the area indicate rising
OL,8,Flevels of contamination as mining
OL,9,Frestarted in the mid 7th Century,
OL,10,Freaching a peak in the 13th Century, at
OL,11,Flevels which outstrip those from the
OL,12,FVictorian era.
OL,14,FOn top of this, female skeletons showed
OL,15,Fhigher lead levels and an earlier age
OL,16,Fof death, which may be linked to
OL,17,Fre-exposure during pregnancy,
OL,18,Fresearchers said.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
